<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-CROATIAN OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CROATIAN OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BOL, Croatia 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the $107,500 Croatian Open Women's WTA Tennis Tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Mirjana Lucic (Croatia) beat 1-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Corina Morariu (U.S.) beat Emanuelle Gagliardi (Switzerland) 6-1 1-6 6-3.</p>
</text>
